1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
When the pressure hits like thunder in my chest,
Old roads light up, saying this will help me rest.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Fast reactions, shadows moving on their own,
But I am learning now I do not have to walk alone.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Breathe in, breathe out,
Feel the ground beneath my feet.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:24,000
There is a moment in the middle
Where the loop can break for me.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:31,000
In the pause between the trigger and the choice,
I can hear a calmer, stronger voice.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Not erasing every scar I have known,
Just rewiring what I call my home.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Hypnotherapy helps me see
I am more than urgency.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,000
In the pause between the dark and dawn,
I find the strength to carry on.

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
If the body needs a doctor, I will go,
Some storms need medical hands before they slow.

10
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:04,000
But in the mind where habits echo late at night,
I can train a different pattern toward the light.

11
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Name the cue, let it pass,
Let the wave roll through my skin.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:16,000
I do not have to chase the old relief
To feel safe within.

13
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Tap the fear down, soften the fire,
EFT steadies my trembling wire.

14
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Then I go deeper, gentle and slow,
Teaching my nervous system a different road.

15
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:34,000
No shame, no rush, no perfect line,
Just one true breath at a time.

16
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Every day I practice being free,
From the loops that once were leading me.

17
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Step by step, I come alive,
Not just coping, but learning to thrive.

18
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:54,000
In the pause between the dark and dawn,
I find the strength to carry on.

19
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:00,000
A calm head, an inner loop,
A new path written in the truth.
